      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1989010363111862366",
      "text": "[5:30p.m.] #VI #VictoriaIsland #TrafficUpdate \n\nAs we dive deep into closing hours, traffic though on the high side moving out of VI, we still have it good.\n\n- Ozumba Mbadiwe is steady from Law School inwards Bony Camp; \n- 1004 Second gate to Civic Center and the Falomo Ramp inwards Falomo Bridge is steady;\n- Adeola Odeku inward Ahmadu Bello Way is steady;\n- Adetokunboh Ademola inward Eko Hotel R/About is steady;\n- Ajose Adeogun inward Eko Hotel R/About is steady as well.\n\nOur Men are strategically located to ensure traffic is good.\n\n@Sola_Giwa\n@gm_lastma\n@followlasg\n@GoldmyneTV\n@Mr_JAGs\n@gbenga_omo\n@TrafficChiefNG\n@channelstv\n@lagosMOT1\n@lagostraffic961\n@daily_trust\n@thecableng\n@walemusa\n@seunosiyemi_\n@vanguardngrnews\n@MobilePunch\n@NigeriaNewsdesk\n@TheNationNews\n@channelstv\n@FRSCNigeria\n@OlalekanOki\n@rrslagos767\n@HeroPrince_21 \n@tobiidowu_ \n@Gidi_Traffic",
